      "text": "#EXCLUSIVE MISSISSIPPI MACHETE MURDER CASE: An illegal immigrant from Honduras has been indicted on a murder charge after prosecutors say he killed his roommate in a machete attack in Southaven, Mississippi.\n\nA DeSoto County grand jury indicted Maberic Reyes-Reyes in connection with the January 13, 2026 killing. @DHSgov says Reyes-Reyes illegally entered the U.S. through Texas as a minor in 2022 and was later released into the country.\n\n@ICEgov lodged a detainer against Reyes-Reyes on January 14th, one day after the alleged attack. DHS says it is working with local law enforcement to ensure he remains in custody and faces removal proceedings if convicted.",
